--set-exit-if-changed` clean on the changed file; full repo unit gate `dart test --exclude-tags integration` green. No production code changed in this lap — the rework commit is test-only (+25/−6).\n\nCI note: the failed \"Golden suite (macOS baselines)\" check is foreign to this PR — it is a 0.01% (40px) pixel diff in `flutter_app/test/golden/chat_golden_test.dart` (`goldens/chat_image.png`), a file this PR never touches and a package that does not import either changed file. Details in the PR-level rework comment."
